<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <style>
        .off-wrap { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
        .off-card { max-width: 420px; }
        .off-ico {
            width: 84px; height: 84px; margin: 0 auto 18px; border-radius: 24px;
            background: var(--brand-soft); color: var(--brand);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 2rem;
        }
        .off-card h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0 0 8px; }
        .off-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 20px; }
        .off-hint { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 18px; line-height: 1.6; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="off-wrap">
        <div class="off-card">
            <div class="off-ico"><i class="fas fa-wifi" style="transform:rotate(55deg);"></i></div>
            <h1>You're offline</h1>
            <p>Prepium needs an internet connection for quizzes, AI tools and your study data. Reconnect to pick up where you left off.</p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="location.reload()"><i class="fas fa-rotate-right"></i> Try again</button>
            <p class="off-hint">Your account and saved study materials are safe on the server — nothing is lost while you're offline.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
